        "custom_liquid": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Payment Methods (United Kingdom)</title>\n\n<!-- Poppins font -->\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<style>\n.cb-container{\n  font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;\n  color:#333;\n  max-width:900px;\n  margin:0 auto;\n  padding:2rem 1.5rem;\n}\n.cb-container h1,.cb-container h2{\n  font-weight:600;\n  margin:1.6em 0 0.6em;\n  opacity:0;\n  transform:translateY(10px);\n  animation:fadeInUp .8s ease forwards;\n}\n.cb-container p,.cb-container li{\n  font-size:16px;\n  line-height:1.6;\n}\nul,ol{margin:.4em 0 1.1em 1.2em;}\n.cb-container a{\n  color:#555;\n  text-decoration:underline;\n  transition:color .25s ease,text-decoration-color .25s ease;\n}\n.cb-container a:hover{\n  color:#000;\n  text-decoration-color:#000;\n}\n@media(min-width:768px){\n  .cb-container{padding:3rem 2rem;}\n}\n@keyframes fadeInUp{to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"cb-container\">\n  <h1>Payment Methods (United Kingdom)</h1>\n  <p>We currently accept the following payment methods for UK orders:</p>\n\n  <h2>1) Credit &amp; Debit Cards (processed by Shopify Payments)</h2>\n  <p>Pay securely with major cards (e.g., Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Maestro) processed by Shopify Payments. Transactions are encrypted and may require Strong Customer Authentication (SCA) (e.g., 3-D Secure) as required by UK regulation. If prompted, follow your bank’s on-screen verification to complete checkout.</p>\n\n  <p><strong>Refunds to cards:</strong> Once we approve a refund, we submit it to your card issuer immediately. Your bank/card provider controls when funds appear; this can take up to 3–10 business days depending on the institution.</p>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
