      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"cb-container\">\n  <style>\n    .cb-container {\n      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n      color: #333;\n      max-width: 900px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;\n    }\n    .cb-container h2, .cb-container h3 {\n      font-weight: 600;\n      margin: 1.6em 0 0.6em;\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: translateY(10px);\n      animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease forwards;\n    }\n    .cb-container p, .cb-container li {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n    ul {\n      margin: 0.4em 0 1.1em 1.2em;\n    }\n    .cb-container a {\n      color: #555;\n      text-decoration: underline;\n      transition: color 0.25s ease, text-decoration-color 0.25s ease;\n    }\n    .cb-container a:hover {\n      color: #000;\n      text-decoration-color: #000;\n    }\n    @keyframes fadeInUp {\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <h2>2) Klarna</h2>\n  <p>We offer Klarna at checkout (availability subject to Klarna’s approval). Klarna may present one or more of the options below, depending on eligibility:</p>\n\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Pay in 3:</strong> Split your purchase into three interest-free instalments, collected automatically every 30 days.</li>\n    <li><strong>Pay in 30 days:</strong> Try first, pay up to 30 days after shipment.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3>Important Klarna information (UK)</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>18+, UK residents only. Credit subject to status.</li>\n    <li>Pay in 3 and Pay in 30 days are unregulated credit agreements. Borrowing more than you can afford or paying late may negatively impact your financial status and ability to obtain credit.</li>\n    <li>Late fees may apply.</li>\n    <li>Terms, conditions and exclusions apply. See \n      <a href=\"https://www.klarna.com/uk/terms-and-conditions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Klarna’s UK Terms</a> \n      and \n      <a href=\"https://www.klarna.com/uk/customer-service/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Buyer Protection</a> \n      for details, or contact Klarna Customer Service via the Klarna app/website.\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <p><strong>Who you’re contracting with:</strong> Klarna is the lender for Klarna purchases; we are not the lender. Klarna performs its own checks and decides whether to offer you credit.</p>\n</div>",
